// Fusion PostgreSQL database schema in DBML format.
// Generated by /sync-sdlc on 2026-09-20 from the Drizzle table definitions in packages/core/src/postgres/schema/ (the source of truth).
// Three PostgreSQL schemas share one cluster: `project` (per-project working data), `central` (global coordination), `archive` (cold storage).
// Plugin-owned tables live in the `project` schema and are materialized via schema-init hooks.
// Type notes: `text` timestamps are ISO-8601 strings preserved verbatim from SQLite; integer 0/1 flags are kept as integer to avoid truthiness drift; `bytea` is a custom Drizzle type mapping SQLite BLOB; `tsvector` is a custom type for full-text search GENERATED ALWAYS columns; `float` maps the Drizzle `real` columns.
// Defaults are database-side expressions (often the `fusion.project_id` GUC ownership stamp); see the source files for exact expressions.

